   <section xml:id=3D"cll_chapter2-section7">
     <title>Varying the order of sumti</title>
     <para>For one reason or another you may want to change the order, plac=
ing one particular sumti at the front of the bridi. The cmavo=20
     <quote>se</quote>, when placed before the last word of the selbri, wil=
