 <jbophrase role=3D"selbri">mo</jbophrase>
        You     are-what/do-what?
 </programlisting>
     <para>A=20
     <quote>mo</quote> may be used anywhere a brivla or other selbri might.=
 Keep this in mind for later examples. Unfortunately, by itself,=20
     <quote>mo</quote> is a very non-specific question. The response to the=
